Package: vantorr
Title: Access 'Maxar' and 'Vantor' Satellite Imagery APIs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Wild", , "mWild@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a client for the 'Maxar' and 'Vantor' Hub APIs
    (<https://developers.maxar.com/docs/>), enabling programmatic access to
    high-resolution satellite imagery (such as 'WorldView', 'Vivid' basemaps,
    and analysis-ready data). Includes functions for 'OAuth2' and API key
    authentication, discovery and 'STAC' catalog search, 'OGC' web services
    ('WMS', 'WMTS', 'WFS'), and spatial data retrieval integrated with 'sf',
    'terra', and 'stars'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/michael-cw/vantorr, https://developers.maxar.com/docs/
BugReports: https://github.com/michael-cw/vantorr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
